### ================================================
### 心理支持聊天机器人系统 - 后端接口测试脚本
### 依赖：后端运行在 http://localhost:8080
### 使用方式：用 REST Client 插件（VS Code / IntelliJ）按块运行
### ================================================

### ================== 公开接口 ==================

### 1. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/welcome

### 2. 问候接口
GET http://localhost:8080/greet?name=Student

### 3. 用户注册
### @name register
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test_user",
  "password": "test123456"
}

### 4. 用户登录（普通用户）
### @name login_user
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test_user",
  "password": "test123456"
}

### 5. 管理员登录
### @name login_admin
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### ================== 用户接口（需 Bearer Token） ==================
### 提示：在 REST Client 中定义环境变量，或将下面 {{token}} 替换为登录接口返回的 token

### 6. 创建会话
### @name create_session
POST http://localhost:8080/chat/session/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试心理对话"
}

### 7. 获取会话列表
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/session/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 查询历史记录（sessionId 替换为实际值）
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/history?sessionId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 流式对话 SSE（用 curl 测试，sessionId 替换为实际值）
### curl -N -H "Authorization: Bearer {{token}}" \
###   "http://localhost:8080/chat/stream?sessionId=1&content=我最近心情很低落&modelCode=deepseek"

### 10. 获取会话情绪历史（sessionId 替换为实际值）
GET http://localhost:8080/emotion/session/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 获取情绪变化趋势（最近 7 天）
GET http://localhost:8080/emotion/trend?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. 获取会话最新情绪状态（sessionId 替换为实际值）
GET http://localhost:8080/emotion/latest/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 根据情绪推荐资源
GET http://localhost:8080/resource/recommend?emotionType=depression&emotionScore=0.3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. 获取所有资源列表
GET http://localhost:8080/resource/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. 获取资源详情（id 替换为实际值）
GET http://localhost:8080/resource/detail/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. 获取我的推荐记录
GET http://localhost:8080/resource/my/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. 获取可选模型列表
GET http://localhost:8080/model/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. 获取当前使用模型
GET http://localhost:8080/model/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. 切换模型（modelCode 替换为实际值，如 deepseek / qwen / kimi）
POST http://localhost:8080/model/select
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelCode": "deepseek"
}

### 20. 获取我的危机预警列表
GET http://localhost:8080/crisis/user/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ================== 管理员接口（需 ADMIN 角色） ==================
### 提示：将 {{admin_token}} 替换为管理员登录返回的 token

### 21. 获取所有待处理危机预警
GET http://localhost:8080/crisis/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 22. 处理危机预警（alertId 替换为实际值）
POST http://localhost:8080/crisis/handle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerNotes": "已电话联系用户，情况稳定"
}

### 23. 管理员分页获取资源列表
GET http://localhost:8080/resource/admin/list?category=crisis&pageNum=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 24. 管理员新增资源
POST http://localhost:8080/resource/admin/add
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "心理援助热线",
  "content": "全国24小时心理援助热线：400-161-9995",
  "category": "hotline",
  "tags": "危机,热线,紧急",
  "enabled": 1
}

### 25. 管理员更新资源（id 替换为实际值）
PUT http://localhost:8080/resource/admin/update/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "心理援助热线（更新）",
  "content": "更新后的内容",
  "category": "hotline",
  "tags": "危机,热线",
  "enabled": 1
}

### 26. 管理员启用/禁用资源（id 替换为实际值）
PUT http://localhost:8080/resource/admin/toggle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": 0
}

### 27. 管理员删除资源（id 替换为实际值）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/resource/admin/delete/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 28. 管理员查看所有推荐记录
GET http://localhost:8080/resource/admin/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ================== 错误场景测试 ==================

### 29. 未登录访问需鉴权接口 → 期望返回 401
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/session/list

### 30. 普通用户访问管理员接口 → 期望返回 403
GET http://localhost:8080/crisis/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 31. 查询不存在的会话历史 → 期望返回 403 或空列表
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/history?sessionId=999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 32. 获取不存在的资源详情 → 期望返回 404
GET http://localhost:8080/resource/detail/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
